      {
        "id": 10735,
        "name": "Pinecone3",
        "username": "Pinecone3",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pinecone3/{size}/2494_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-07-12T22:22:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Here's a solo scenario I wrote for SotM:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Next Evolution</p><p><i>History</i>: After his father fell at the hands of <b>Baron Blade</b>, <b>Legacy</b> set out to destroy the evil battle suit that <b>Blade</b> had used. <b>Baron Blade</b> rallied his troops, but given <b>Legacy's</b> new impenetrable skin, he might have bitten off more than he could chew...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Setup:</i></p><ul>\n<li><p>This is a 1-person scenario. Use <b>Baron Blade</b> (Vengeful Mad Scientist), America's Finest <b>Legacy</b>, and the <b>Mobile Defense Platform</b>.</p></li>\n<li><p>Remove “Heroic Interception,” “Bolster Allies,” and “Lead from the Front” from <b>Legacy's </b>Deck.</p></li>\n<li><p>Remove “Mobile Defense Platform” (The battle takes place <i>inside </i>it), “Elemental Redistributor” (A worthless weapon against <b>Legacy,</b> the <b>Baron</b> wouldn't bother using it), and “Hasten Doom” (<b>Blade</b> hasn't invented the Anti-Legacy serum yet) from <b>Baron Blade's</b> deck.</p></li>\n<li><p><b>Legacy</b> starts play with “The Legacy Ring,” “Motivational Charge,” and “Fortitude” in play.</p></li>\n<li><p><b>Baron Blade</b> starts with only 25 HP on his “Vengeful Made Scientist” side (this is an older version of his battle suit).</p></li>\n<li><p>Otherwise, the game works normally.</p></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>End of Game:</i> Whenever one side is incapacitated, the other side wins.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Balance:</i></p><ul>\n<li><p>If you're finding the scenario too easy, start without “Fortitude” in play, or with a “Blade Battalion” in play.</p></li>\n<li><p>If you're finding the scenario too hard, let <b>Legacy</b> go first, then play normally.</p></li>\n</ul>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:51.995Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
